# Phase 2 CLI acceptance — operator reference-corpus path (QV-015, ADR-0114)
#
# Segment 5 of 6 (host-backed, D-13): an incompatible reference queues like
# any other import. The harness synchronizes on the host-owned terminal state
# — bounded retries per D-15, then an inspectable dead letter — before segment
# 6 proves nothing was staged.
#
# The identity fixture is never imported elsewhere, so the operator sees only
# the reference-comparison failure.

```console
$ qai quran import ../../fixtures/quran/test-edition-identity/manifest.json --reference ../../fixtures/quran/test-edition-rich/reference.json
queued test-edition-identity@0.1.0 import as job [..] (state: Queued)
inspect with `qai job show [..]`; `qai serve` processes queued work
note: synthetic test data — non-canonical (ADR-0101 fallback)

```
